ame>Ragland</surname><given-names>RL</given-names></name><name><surname>Tenreiro</surname></name></person-group><article-title>Intraspinal disclocation of the rib in neurofibromatosis: a case report</article-title><source>Pediatr Radiol</source><year>1995</year><volume>25</volume><fpage>538</fpage><lpage>539</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/BF02015788</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Kamath SV, Kleinman PK, Ragland RL, Tenreiro &#x02013;Picon OR, Knor JR (1995) Intraspinal disclocation of the rib in neurofibromatosis: a case report. Pediatr Radiol 25:538&#x02013;539 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8545185</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR10"><label>10.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Khoshhal</surname><given-names>KI</given-names></name><name><surname>Ellis</surname><given-names>RD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Paraparesis after posterior spinal fusion in neurofibromatosis secondary to rib displacement: case report and literature review</article-title><source>J Pediatr Orthop</source><year>2000</year><volume>20</volume><fpage>799</fpage><lpage>801</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Khoshhal KI, Ellis RD (2000) Paraparesis after posterior spinal fusion in neurofibromatosis secondary to rib displacement: case report and literature review. J Pediatr Orthop 20:799&#x02013;801 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11097258</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR11"><label>11.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Legrand</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Filipe</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Blamoutier</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Khouri</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Mary</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Intraspinal rib penetration in four patients in neurofibromatosis vertebral deformities</article-title><source>Rev Chir Orthop Reparatrice Appar Mot</source><year>2003</year><volume>89</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>57</fpage><lpage>61</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Legrand B, Filipe G, Blamoutier A, Khouri N, Mary P (2003) Intraspinal rib penetration in four patients in neurofibromatosis vertebral deformities. Rev Chir Orthop Reparatrice Appar Mot 89(1):57&#x02013;61 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12610437</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR12"><label>12.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mukhtar</surname><given-names>IA</given-names></name><name><surname>Letts</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Kontio</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Spinal cord impingement by a displaced rib in scoliosis due to neurofibromatosis</article-title><source>Can J Surg</source><year>2005</year><volume>48</volume><issue>5</issue><fpage>414</fpage><lpage>415</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Mukhtar IA, Letts M, Kontio K (2005) Spinal cord impingement by a displaced rib in scoliosis due to neurofibromatosis. Can J Surg 48(5):414&#x02013;415 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16248144</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>